5-2016</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"243\">Imamul Hasan</td>\r\n<td width=\"229\">Counsellor</td>\r\n<td width=\"189\">12<sup>th</sup></td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1 Year</td>\r\n<td width=\"154\">03-01-2016</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"243\">Sanjay Basfore</td>\r\n<td width=\"229\">House Keeping</td>\r\n<td width=\"189\">Literate</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1 Year</td>\r\n<td width=\"154\">03-01-2016</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"243\">Kallu Basfore</td>\r\n<td width=\"229\">House Keeping</td>\r\n<td width=\"189\">Literate</td>\r\n<td width=\"173\">1 Year</td>\r\n<td width=\"154\">03-01-2016</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'Non Teaching Staff', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '166-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-01-16 19:07:31', '2020-01-16 19:07:31', '', 166, 'http://srioms.co.in/index.php/2020/01/16/166-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(168, 1, '2020-01-16 19:09:17', '2020-01-16 19:09:17', '<img width=\"410\" height=\"522\" src=\"http://srioms.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/nkpandey.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://srioms.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/nkpandey.jpg 410w, http://srioms.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/nkpandey-236x300.jpg 236w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 410px) 100vw, 410px\" />											\n			<h2>Dr. N. K. Pandey</h2>		\n		<h5>Dear Visitors &amp; Students,</h5><p align=\"justify\">I effusively thank you and take this opportunity to welcome you all to the Shri Ram Institute of Medical Sciences, Siwan Bihar, I also feel honored and privileged to dedicate the Shri Ram Institute of Medical Sciences to the people of Bihar neighboring states and beyond. With the opening of this Paramedical College and Diagnostic Center, a long time felt need of the people of this region has come to fruition.</p><p align=\"justify\">The Shri Ram Institute of Medical Sciences is committed to provide quality health care facilities to people who either feel deprived of or do not have sufficient means to support expensive health care. We are also committed to ensure highest possible personalized patients care through committed faculty who do not just treat but deliver long term health benefits to the patients. We will ensure an ethical and transparent atmosphere where doctor-patient relationship occupies highest priority.</p><p align=\"justify\">I can assure you all that over a period of time we would like to be positioned as one of the best in the field of medical education and health care. We do realize that our journey is difficult but we are confident that with our human resource, facilities, public support and administration’ help, will lead to realize and fulfill our dreams to deliver highest level of medical knowledge.</p><p align=\"justify\">The Institute will provide you with the state of the art facilities for learning. I hope you will concentrate your energy on not only acquiring knowledge and skills necessary to be a successful professional but also in acquiring and inculcating the more important skills for life communication, compassion, ethical values and most importantly dynamic leadership. I want you to utilize all these for your betterment to become an all rounder, genuine and dependable asset of our Nation; so that you look back one day and feel proud of your Alma-Mater.</p><p style=\"text-align: right;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>With best wishes</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Dr. N. K. Pandey</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Secretary</strong></p>		\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Facebook-f\n											</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Twitter\n											</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n						Linkedin-in\n											</a>', 'Secretary Message', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'secretary-message', '', '', '2021-01-02 09:26:47', '2021-01-02 09:26:47', '', 0, 'http://srioms.co.in/?page_id=168', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(169, 1, '2020-01-16 19:09:17', '2020-01-16 19:09:17', '<h5>Dear Visitors &amp; Students,</h5>\r\n<p align=\"justify\">I effusively thank you and take this opportunity to welcome you all to the Shri Ram Institute of Medical Sciences, Siwan Bihar, I also feel honored and privileged to dedicate the Shri Ram Institute of Medical Sciences to the people of Bihar neighboring states and beyond. With the opening of this Paramedical College and Diagnostic Center, a long time felt need of the people of this region has come to fruition.</p>\r\n<p align=\"justify\">The Shri Ram Institute of Medical Sciences is committed to provide quality health care facilities to people who either feel deprived of or do not have sufficient means to support expensive health care. We are also committed to ensure highest possible personalized patients care through committed faculty who do not just treat but deliver long term health benefits to the patients. We will ensure an ethical and transparent atmosphere where doctor-patient relationship occupies highest priority.</p>\r\n<p align=\"justify\">I can assure you all that over a period of time we would like to be positioned as one of the best in the field of medical education and health care. We do realize that our journey is difficult but we are confident that with our human resource, facilities, public support and administration’ help, will lead to realize and fulfill our dreams to deliver highest level of medical knowledge.</p>\r\n<p align=\"justify\">The Institute will provide you with the state of the art facilities for learning. I hope you will concentrate your energy on not only acquiring knowledge and skills necessary to be a successful professional but also in acquiring and inculcating the more important skills for life communication, compassion, ethical values and most importantly dynamic leadership. I want you to utilize all these for your betterment to become an all rounder, genuine and dependable asset of our Nation; so that you look back one day and feel proud of your Alma-Mater.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>With best wishes</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Dr. N. K. Pandey</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" align=\"justify\"><strong>Secretary</strong></p>', 'Secretary Message', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '168-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-01-16 19:09:17', '2020-01-16 19:09:17', '', 168, 'http://srioms.co.in/index.php/2020/01/16/168-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
