(277, 1, '2020-12-31 11:15:18', '2020-12-31 11:15:18', '[popup_cookie name=\"popmake-267\" expires=\"10 days\"]\r\n\r\nIn country like India where there is a high rate of unemployment these courses are designed to provide immediate employment to the candidates. The Secretary Dr. N.K. Pandey ia a MD of M/S Shri Ram M.R.I. Scan Center. Based at Siwan. He Travels abroad frequently and Understands that the employment avenues are growing globally for Paramedical Personnel’s. The Society unlike other Institutes in India has its own Equipments like MRI, CT Scan, Color Doppler, Digital X-Ray, OPG, EEG, ECG, TMT,PFT, Mammography, Lithotripsy and well equipped Medical Lab For Practical training of its Students. Society is affiliated with Bihar State Government &amp; AICT Approved.', 'Welcome to SRIOMS', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '10-revision-v1', '', '', '2020-12-31 11:15:18', '2020-12-31 11:15:18', '', 10, 'http://srioms.co.in/index.php/2020/12/31/10-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
