(340, 1, '2021-01-02 10:04:34', '2021-01-02 10:04:34', '<img width=\"166\" height=\"187\" src=\"http://srioms.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Capture-2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />											\n			<h4>Dr. Candra Shekhar Mishra </h4>		\n		<p>The globalized world we live in offers many challenges and opportunities Education, healthcare awareness, cultural development and women empowerment by such challenges. The Shri Ram Rural welfare Educational Society since its inception has continued to direct efforts on a sustainable basis in a attempt to tackle the many socio-economic problems that face us- the route taken is through education, healthcare awareness etc.</p><p><strong>Dr. Candra Shekhar Mishra</strong> </p><p><strong>President</strong></p>', 'President\'s Message', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '327-revision-v1', '', '', '2021-01-02 10:04:34', '2021-01-02 10:04:34', '', 327, 'http://srioms.co.in/index.php/2021/01/02/327-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(341, 1, '2021-01-02 10:34:31', '2021-01-02 10:34:31', '<img class=\"wp-image-850 aligncenter\" src=\"https://srioms.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-15-at-3.35.21-PM.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"329\" height=\"340\" style=\"border-radius:50%\" />\r\n<h4>Dr. Jai Narayan Prasad,</h4>\r\n<strong>Dear Visitors &amp; Students,</strong>\r\n\r\nIt gives me immense pleasure to welcome Paramedical student on behalf of Faculty &amp; Staff of Shri Ram Institute of Medical Science, Siwan, Bihar. Excellence in medical education can be attained by strengthening the quality and commitment of the teachers and other staff at Shri Ram Institute of medical Science. We are proud to have experienced and renowned faculty members. We consider it our solemn duty and responsibility to provide a learning environment that is second to none.\r\n\r\nAt Shri Ram Institute of Medical Sciences we will be providing state of the art facilities for teaching and training in terms of infrastructure, machinery and equipment to support health care system and teaching facilities. All lecture theaters are air conditioned and have the facility of multimedia projection. We have a spacious air conditioned Library with latest collection of text books and journals. Al these facilities wi1 enable the students to acquire knowledge and skill required for capacity building.\r\n\r\nI sincerely hope that our students will effectively utilize their time and energy to upgrade their capability and turn out to be role model health care professionals. Integrating compassion, care and above all become service providers to the deprived and under privileged section of the society. Our effort is to develop patient, students and environment friendly institute.\r\n\r\nThe Institute &amp; Diagnostics Center will serve people of Bihar and Uttar Pradesh.) would request you to browse through various section of the site and shall be grateful if relevant comments/suggestions are given.\r\n\r\nI wish you a fruitful &amp; meaningful association and let you dreams be realized and In tum we attain our objective through you.\r\n\r\n<strong>With best wishes</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong> Dr.  J N. Prasad</strong>', 'Principal\'s Message', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'principals-message', '', '', '2025-11-15 10:07:28', '2025-11-15 10:07:28', '', 0, 'http://srioms.co.in/?page_id=341', 0, 'page', '', 0),
